// Chance that a floor or wall next to a collapsing one gives way too (StructureCollapse).
// Each neighbor rolls once, with 4 neighbors per tile. Intact floor (health 1) still tears
// with a small chance, so an isolated weak spot takes about 5 tiles with a long tail; walls
// only roll when damaged. Above ~0.6 a region is likely to go whole (up to the room edge or
// StructureCollapseMaxTiles), so heavy damage collapses far.
{
    // health percent => chance to collapse along
    "FloatSet" : [
        0.0, 1.0,
        0.25, 0.85,
        0.5, 0.6,
        0.75, 0.4,
        1.0, 0.25
    ]
}
